# Local state, plans and generated variables (secrets.env-derived). Never commit.
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
tfplan
crash.log
crash.*.log
terraform.tfvars
*.auto.tfvars
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
# .terraform.lock.hcl IS committed (pins provider versions + checksums).
